WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:11.450
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.476
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.588
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.221
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.852
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:43.039
Kyou kasho...seifuku...
mada kami, kawakanai...

00:00:44.383 --> 00:00:49.844
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.621
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.329
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:08.870
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:15.612
Amakute nigai. . .marmalade

00:01:15.747 --> 00:01:18.181
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.717 --> 00:01:20.742
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.983
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.984
Aitsu no egao ni aitai!

00:02:07.733 --> 00:02:15.697
DEPARTURE —
"LOVE WILL GO ON."

00:11:30.028 --> 00:11:32.428
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.398
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:23.814 --> 00:22:28.342
Kokoro ga arawareru

00:22:28.485 --> 00:22:33.718
Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:22:33.858 --> 00:22:38.454
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:22:38.596 --> 00:22:44.057
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:22:44.201 --> 00:22:49.138
Donna ni tooku

00:22:49.273 --> 00:22:54.233
Hanarete ite mo

00:22:54.378 --> 00:22:59.247
Onnaji yoake wo

00:22:59.383 --> 00:23:04.753
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:04.889 --> 00:23:09.519
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:14.962
Omoide wo musubu ito

00:23:15.099 --> 00:23:20.162
Mirai no mirai ni mo

00:23:20.304 --> 00:23:25.332
Kamisama ga itekureru

00:23:25.476 --> 00:23:31.745
Kamisama ga itekureru
